Error [jet.ProgramEntryMixed]: Top-level statements at `program_entry_mixed_renamed_import.jet:8` and the `run` import at `program_entry_mixed_renamed_import.jet:5` are two entries of one program
  --> Tests/UI/program_entry_mixed_renamed_import.jet:8:1
