  8 | print("before")
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A program is script style, its entry file's top-level statements, or one `run: fn`, never both, so it starts in one place
 Fix: Move the statements into the function the `run` import names, or rename the import so the statements run
